 and challenges \u2013 </strong>jumps, traps, and environmental interactions that will test your precision and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, focused adventure </strong>\u2013 perfect for an intense evening or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions </strong>\u2013 all current and future content is included with your purchase.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mediakomp"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413360/header.jpg?t=1757528425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195769,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195769/movie480.mp4?t=1757526056","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195769/movie_max.mp4?t=1757526056"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195769/d836a7ee479c8f2fcf643c49a1759ae221973d20/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757526056","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195769/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757526056","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195769/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757526056"}}],"name":"Christmas Soul","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Mediakomp"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors"